  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "This class serves as the central, static entry point for managing all engine resources, specifically scoping resources to individual WebGL rendering contexts. It acts as a high-level service layer, orchestrating the use of ResourceManager and ResourceLoader to provide context-aware resource management. It allows for global configuration of loaders and URI resolvers, enabling fine-grained control over asset loading and lifecycle management across multiple rendering environments."
  },
